<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Yaohan Intl shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Yaohan Intl shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Yaohan International Holdings Ltd was suspended on Wednesday at the request of the company pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>Trading in shares of Pacific Concord Holdings Ltd was also suspended on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The companies announced on Tuesday that Pacific Concord would acquire 196.4 million shares of Yaohan International at HK$0.684 per share from the chairman of Yaohan Group and his family.</p>
<p>Yaohan International shares closed at HK$0.66 on Tuesday and Pacific Concord at HK$3.45.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
</text>
